@GameApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5254
@token = paste-token-from-login-here

### TC01/TC02 - Đăng ký
POST {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sinhvien01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### TC04/TC05 - Đăng nhập
POST {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sinhvien01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### TC08 - Tạo nhân vật
POST {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/characters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hiep Si Rong",
  "class": "Warrior"
}

### TC10/TC11 - Sửa nhân vật
PUT {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/characters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hiep Si Rong",
  "class": "Paladin",
  "level": 5,
  "hp": 250
}
